This C program interfaces with a Melexis MLX90817 absolute pressure sensor on I2C bus 1. It reads the sensor once per second and appends each measurement to a file named `pressure_log.csv` with an ISO 8601 UTC timestamp and the pressure in kPa. The program checks every I2C call and every file operation for errors, prints to stderr the register and the driver error code on any I2C read failure while continuing without logging, handles sensor-absent conditions such as I2C open failure or repeated read failures, and on receipt of SIGINT or SIGTERM it cleanly closes the I2C handle, flushes and closes the log file, and invokes the library's cleanup API before exiting.

