This C program sets up the necessary GPIO pins for SPI communication and initializes the SPI device. It then enters a loop where it reads the analog data from the DFRobot Soil Moisture Sensor v2.0 connected to the MCP3008 ADC, calculates the moisture percentage, and logs the results to the console every 5 seconds. The program handles errors and releases resources on program termination by handling SIGINT and SIGTERM signals.

