This C program initializes the SPI interface and GPIO lines for controlling the chip-select lines of three MCP3008 ADC chips. It reads the ADC values from each sensor every 5 seconds and writes them to a CSV file named `soil_moisture_log.csv`. The program handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals to gracefully shut down by closing the file descriptor and releasing all resources.

