This C program initializes the SPI interface, GPIO for the relay, and a log file. It continuously reads the moisture level from the DFROBOT Soil Moisture Sensor connected to an MCP3008 ADC on SPI0, checks if the moisture level is below the threshold, and activates the relay-driven water pump if necessary. The program logs each reading along with the pump status and timestamp to a file named `irrigation.log`. It handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals to turn off the pump, close the SPI interface, close the log file, and cleanly terminate the driver library.

