This C program continuously reads the Sharp GP2Y0A21YK0F IR distance sensor connected to GPIO17 on a Raspberry Pi 5. It logs each read to a file named `distance_log.txt` with a timestamp, prints "Feeder Activated" if the sensed distance is less than 200 mm, and "Feeder Idle" otherwise. The program handles errors opening or reading the GPIO file by retrying after a one-second delay, retries after one second on any other error, and ensures that on receipt of SIGINT or SIGTERM, it cleanly unexports GPIO17 and exits.

