This C program sets up the necessary GPIO and SPI interfaces for reading from the DRV5055-A1 Hall-effect sensor through an external MCP3008 ADC. It reads the sensor voltage on MCP3008 channel 0 every 500 ms, converts the raw integer reading to magnetic field strength using integer arithmetic, and appends a CSV line to a file named `magnetic_log.txt`. The program handles errors and releases resources on all exit paths, including SIGINT and SIGTERM.

