This C program initializes the Raspberry Pi Zero W to communicate with a Sensirion STS30-DS temperature-only sensor over I2C bus 1. It performs a single-shot high-repeatability measurement, waits for the conversion to complete, reads the three-byte response, validates the CRC-8 checksum, and records each successful reading with an ISO-8601 timestamp to a file named `enclosure_temp_log.txt`. It also logs any errors to a file named `error_log.txt` and handles SIGINT to perform a graceful shutdown.

