This C program initializes the SHT35 sensor on I2C bus 1, reads temperature and humidity every five seconds, logs each reading to a CSV file, and handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals to perform a clean shutdown. It uses the `libgpiod` library for I2C communication and validates the CRC8 checksums of the sensor readings.

