This C program reads temperature and humidity from a Sensirion SHTC3 sensor connected to a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B via I2C. It handles I2C communication, CRC validation, and logging of valid readings. The program also includes a SIGINT handler to clean up resources and exit cleanly.

