This C program continuously polls three KY-033 Obstacle Avoidance Sensors connected via the GPIO bus on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+. It writes each timestamped reading to a CSV file named `path_log.csv` with columns "timestamp,left,middle,right". The program handles SIGINT by cleanly releasing all GPIO lines, closing the chip, flushing and closing the log file before exiting.

