This C program sets up a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B to use the SparkFun ADXL345 I2C accelerometer. It configures the INT1 pin to trigger an interrupt on free-fall events, reads the device ID, places the sensor in standby mode, and continuously captures and logs acceleration data while free-fall is active. The program handles errors and exits cleanly on SIGINT or SIGTERM.

