This C program initializes the MPU-6050 accelerometer/gyroscope on I2C bus 1, reads tilt data every 100 ms, computes roll and pitch, prints them to the console, appends them to a CSV file named `tilt_log.txt`, and turns an LED on if the absolute value of roll or pitch exceeds 45 degrees. It also handles SIGINT to clean up resources and terminate the program gracefully.

