This C program reads tri-axial acceleration data from an Omron D7S seismic sensor over the I2C bus and logs the timestamped X, Y, Z values in g to a CSV file named `seismic_data.csv`. It also logs any error messages with timestamps to `seismic_error.log`. The program accepts command-line options to specify the I2C address, sampling interval, and output filename. It handles transient failures, sensor-absent, and bus-error conditions, and gracefully shuts down on SIGINT and SIGTERM.

